<title>USA: Hayes Wheels wins Citroen wheel contract.</title>
<headline>Hayes Wheels wins Citroen wheel contract.</headline>
<dateline>ROMULUS, Mich. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayes Wheels International Inc said Tuesday it has received a contract to supply cast aluminum wheels for PSA Peugeot Citroen's Citroen ZX passenger car, beginning with the 1998 model year.</p>
<p>Hayes said the wheels will be produced at its facility in Dello, Italy, for shipment to the automaker's assembly plants in France and Spain. Shipment is expected to begin this month.</p>
<p>The value of the contract was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Hayes designs, engineers and makes steel and aluminum wheels and brake drums and rotors for the automotive and commercial highway markets in North America, Europe and Asia.</p>
<p>		  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
